  "summary": πToniC is an 8-voice drum machine for Akai Force and MPC, inspired by Microtonic.
Each voice blends filtered noise with one of three sources:

SYNTH: an oscillator that morphs from sine to square;
WAVETABLE (new in 1.2.0): 8 tables, scanned from POS to END on every hit;
SAMPLE: WAV playback.

Per voice: pitch modulation, envelopes, drive, EQ, A/B compare, RAND and ALTER; then reverb and delay, classic or extended (Tidal Verb, Dub Station).
It ships with the 150 Patternarium BEST kits, converted from Microtonic, and can import any Microtonic .mtpreset kit.
πClideaN, its MIDI sequencer companion, holds the same 150 kits with their A+B patterns: load the same number in both and you get the full kit and its groove..",
